ttack to clubs, "],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["hs","wc"],["hs","ec"],["at","making the contract when clubs are 3-3. "],["pg",""],["ls","wc"],["ls","ec"],["up","4"],["hc","sj"],["at","This line of play is only inferior to playing a spade to the @SJ by about one quarter of 1%. As these lines of play are so close, you will be rewarded by taking either line.\n"],["",""]]}}